<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Inv names managing director.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Inv names managing director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guangdong Investment Ltd said on Wednesday it has appointed Herbert Hui, former deputy chief executive of the Hong Kong stock exchange, as managing director, effective May 1.</p>
<p>Hui will be responsible for the overall administration and business operations of the company, the statement said.</p>
<p>Hui's resignation from the Stock of Exchange of Hong Kong is effective April 30.</p>
<p>Guangdong Investment also said managing director Chen Dazhi was appointed vice-chairman, effective May 1.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
